{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_01_end","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-1","storyName":"失途","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"新沃尔西尼没有家族，但家族从未放弃染指新城，他们以公司的名义，试图渗透卡车工会。伊雷妮得知自己的好友正是在替威尼斯家族走私的途中撞伤了莱昂图索。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["伊雷妮","索默尔","家族成员","卡车司机","私人医生","拉维妮娅","？？？","德克萨斯"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"animtext","id":10,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月6日    1:35 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"animtextclean","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"n","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......我让彼得罗他们都出去了，营地暂时不会有人过来。","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮，你昨天晚上和拉维妮娅法官在一起，你知道莱昂图索先生伤得重不重吗？他是不是......","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"他昨晚好像已经抢救过来了，但......情况很不好......","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","volume":"1","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#12$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-15","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":30},{"type":"text","text":"卡车司机像泄了气的皮球一样瘫在了椅子上，他用脏污的手套捂住脸。","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"他还那么年轻，也是个好人......可千万不要——唉，我真是......！","id":32},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"到底怎么回事？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"是意外吗？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我、我也说不上来。我本来正好好地开着车，可突然之间方向盘就不听使唤了......","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我来不及反应，直接撞晕了过去。等醒过来的时候，一切已经发生了。","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"可......哪怕情急之下慌了神，你也不该将重伤的人放在路边不管不顾呀！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"你知不知道！如果再耽误一点抢救时间，莱昂图索先生现在就已经......","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔，你明明不是这样的人。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"对不起，伊雷妮......我真的想要救他的，我知道我应该救他，我不是没种的坏家伙！","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"但、但我必须马上把车开走。","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"为什么？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......","id":52},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔，你别不说话啊。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"车上......有什么东西吗？","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"伊雷妮的声音开始颤抖，瘫坐在椅子上的司机面色惨白。","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":63},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","volume":"1","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮......对不起......","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔，你到底在替谁开车？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"威尼斯载具公司......威尼斯家族。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"空气长久地静默，不知过了多久，伊雷妮才缓缓开口。","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"n","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"是因为小古莉的事情吗？","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮，不用帮我找借口......我知道自己犯了多大的错。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"为什么、为什么宁愿去找他们，也不愿意向互助会寻求帮助呢？","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"你明明是互助会资历最老的司机，你知道咱们在新沃尔西尼的地位有多特殊，市政厅和家族都在盯着我们。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮，治矿石病的药是什么价格，我们都清楚。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"更何况后面把小古莉接到新沃尔西尼之后，安顿她，供她上一个好点的学校，还需要不知道多大的开支......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"还有我，索默尔。当初在西西里城，是你给了我活路，小古莉也是我的妹妹。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮，这根本不是互助会能帮我解决的。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"所以你就一个人......","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......不对。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"不管是接驳其他城市送到港口的物资，还是城内商户之间的货物转运，我们经手的所有东西都必须事先登记。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"这半年，每一次的排班表我都亲自确认过，定期检查也都没有出任何纰漏，你一个人是怎么做到——难道说......","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮，不止我一个人。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_33_g10_smallrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"......所以，你们几个也不知道索默尔去了哪里。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"他会不会已经连夜逃回西西里城了？毕竟撞了代理市长这么大的事......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"警察肯定会一查到底的。咱们的事会不会暴露？偷运违禁品可是市政厅的红线，而且还是帮你们......","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"不不，这件事和威尼斯载具公司可没有关系。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"——","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"什么意思，你不会是想杀了我们灭口吧......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"灭口？哈哈哈，我已经好久没听过这个词了。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":125},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"1","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"放松，别那么紧张，你看我手上如今拿的是武器吗？我只是希望你们不要说不该说的，就这么简单。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"可万一警察真查到我们头上怎么办？","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"一直以来，我们瞒着伊雷妮，顶着市政厅的压力帮你们，如果真的出了事情，你们不能只想着撇清关系！","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"（耸肩）","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"真要细究起来，我们就更无辜了。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"威尼斯载具公司可从未违背过《新都市管理法案》，也从未试图渗透进卡车工会，介入新沃尔西尼的物流系统。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"什、什么意思？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"索默尔想要把自己的女儿接过来治矿石病对吧？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"他找好了医院，却又负担不起费用，只能隔三差五将工会的卡车充当医院的私车，帮后勤部运货。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"在那家医院的资助企业里，威尼斯载具公司排在最末，除了同在新沃尔西尼，我们和索默尔根本谈不上有任何关联。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"不是这样的......","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"还有你，一个酒精成瘾者，每个月有一半时间在驾驶室里坐都坐不稳，为了不丢掉工作，偷偷找人代驾。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"咱们可是签了正式的委托协议的，我只不过是个想挣点外快的代驾员而已。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"我、我那是生了病，不得不镇痛啊......","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"被你们找上的司机，哪个不是被你们抓住了这样那样的把柄——","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"新沃尔西尼可是个讲法律的城市，我们大可站在法庭上，一样一样地摆证据，到时候看看谁的屁股更干净。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"你们——你们这帮人，不拿着刀比拿着刀还可怕......","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"是吗，其实一开始我还觉得自己这副模样蠢得不行。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"......","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1554_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"好了，放轻松点。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"家族成员","text":"与其提心吊胆，不如帮我们追回那批“轮胎”，剩下的事情，我们会解决。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1554_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":164},{"type":"charslot","id":165},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#9$1","focus":"n","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......有多久了？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我是在半年前被他们找上的，在我之前，应该也有几十个司机和他们接触过了。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"没办法......替他们跑一趟货，拿到的钱比我们一个月薪水都要多。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"如果不配合的话，他们有的是办法让我们在这座城市过不下去。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"西西里夫人上台后，叙拉古各个城市推行过的改革不计其数，那帮人适应游戏规则的速度比我们快多了......","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"你是在为自己辩解，还是替其他人说话？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"伊雷妮......求求你，一定要帮帮我们！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"我向你保证！只要过了狂欢节，我们就再也不帮那些人运东西了！","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"你可以把我当肇事凶手供出去，可一定要帮帮其他人，他们实在是没有办法才——","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......名单。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"什么？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"别想骗我，你们做这种事，一定会留一份名单。交给我。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......至少得让我知道，你们有多少人，我才能去想办法。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"——！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":199},{"type":"charslot","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":201},{"type":"text","text":"索默尔放下了一直攥在手上的打火机，在身上翻找着。","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#11$1","focus":"n","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔，你还留着这个打火机......我记得你已经戒烟了。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"毕竟是你送我的礼物，带在手头习惯了。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"其实这是我当时在咱们那家超市附近捡的，我哪有钱买这么名贵的玩意。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"你还记得吗，小古莉的妈妈过世后，你盘下了那家超市，一边带孩子一边照顾生意。后来有一天你在门口发现了无家可归的我。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"虽然你每次都说自己是捡了个不要工钱的进货司机兼售货员，可我知道，是你给了我容身之所，给了我一个家。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"后来托科家族盯上了我们。那只是个小家族，我们已经上架了他们的货，他们还不依不饶，威胁我们把在售的同类商品都撤掉。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我们只是说再商量商量，当天夜里，超市就起了一场火......小古莉也因此感染了矿石病......","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"都是过去的事了，突然提这个干嘛？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"找到了，给。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"卡米洛、吉安、鲁杰罗......还真是让我惊喜啊。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"......对不起。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"别说那么多了。索默尔，你去仓库。那辆正在修的卡车后面放着一个木箱子，去帮我拿来。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"那不是你存的......那是你的全部家当了吧！","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"索默尔","text":"好......好。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":236},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"1.5","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#9$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-350,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":240},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_twohandedblunt","volume":"1","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":244},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"1","id":245},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":246},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1547_1#9$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,-50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_1547_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#9$1","posfrom":"-350,0","posto":"-350,-15","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":253},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dragsofa","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"dr","id":254},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"dr","fadetime":"2","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#9$1","posfrom":"-350,-15","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":257},{"type":"playsound","key":"$gavel1","volume":"1","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ironchaindrop","volume":"1","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔，你不知道的是，这个打火机，就是我在火场旁边捡到的......","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我们来到新沃尔西尼，是因为我们已经一无所有了。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔......人都有犯糊涂的时候。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"但我不能让你毁了这一切。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"charslot","id":272},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_bg_vipward.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_697_1#1$1","id":275},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":276,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_697_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"私人医生","text":"拉维妮娅法官，您来了。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_697_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我来看看莱昂。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"有一件事情需要拜托各位——莱昂的病情，希望不要有什么不相关的人知晓。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_697_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"私人医生","text":"请、请您放心，我能理解......","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_npc_697_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"看来没有走错。","id":296},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_697_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"私人医生","text":"请问你找谁？特殊病房不能随便靠近！","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"没关系，让她进来吧。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"n","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"私人医生","text":"......","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"私人医生","text":"拉维妮娅法官，那我就先去忙了，您有事随时叫我。","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"......德克萨斯。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"好久不见。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"好久不见。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"我刚才在楼下随便买了些千层酥和通心粉，你随便吃点，莱昂图索我来看着。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"你们的邀请函，我收到了。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"......","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"我们一直没等到回复，还以为你这次不打算回新沃尔西尼了呢。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"有点忙。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"可颂拉着拜松在张罗什么跨国新项目，空的叙拉古全境巡演才进行到一半，能天使更是不知道溜去了哪里......","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"人手大减，但是订单一点没少，企鹅物流的业务这段时间都是我在张罗。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"再说这种人头攒动的庆典真让人提不起兴致，我更愿意等到哪天接到一个顺路的委托，就来看看你们。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"那怎么？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"谁让我有个喜欢热闹的老板呢，他有天晚上碰巧看到了那封邀请函，转身就拉着我收拾行李。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"他对你们在办的“主题派对”很感兴趣，推掉了所有工作，让“大地的尽头”歇业半个月，拉着我从龙门一路飞奔过来。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"......","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"轻松一点，拉维妮娅，你的神经绷得很紧。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"莱昂他......","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"我已经知道了个大概。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"不是意外？","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"警察还在勘查。我刚从现场回来......可能性很低。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"有怀疑的对象吗？","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"有。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"还是那些人？","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"嗯。","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"什么原因？","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"按照莱昂原本的安排，狂欢节巡游当晚，他会在全城的巡游队伍面前宣布正式就任新沃尔西尼的市长。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"虽然做出这样的决定并不稀奇，但他未免太过着急了。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"哪怕抛弃了家族，他仍是贝纳尔多·贝洛内的儿子，一年的时间，不足以让人们遗忘贝纳尔多曾在沃尔西尼掀起的惊涛骇浪。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"隐于幕后，更方便他维持新政府的运作，这也是最稳妥的做法，而不是换身衣服，放下防身的法杖，再次走到台前。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"距离新沃尔西尼建成才刚刚一年，有西西里夫人的背书，他这个代理市长的位置也才勉强坐稳。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","volume":"1","id":367},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","delay":"0.4","volume":"1","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","delay":"0.6","channel":"BSE","volume":"1","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"这些话，我都跟他说过。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"......也是。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","volume":"1","id":375},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","delay":"0.4","volume":"1","id":376},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","delay":"0.6","channel":"BSE","volume":"1","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"拉维妮娅，从刚刚开始，你腰上的通讯装置就一直在闪。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":381},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"1","id":382},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"......","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"案子有了新的线索？","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"不，是法院的信息。临时有个案子......","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"比较棘手？","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"嗯。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"德克萨斯，我其实理解莱昂为什么那么着急。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"这一年，新沃尔西尼的变化肉眼可见，很多曾经只存在于我们想象中的事情已经变成了现实。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"......这不正是西西里夫人所希望的吗？","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"但是还不够，远远不够......所以我们必须彰显自己的存在，才能推动更多的变革发生。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"所以我也就没有继续劝他。结果......","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"你们还是跟以前一样，不，比那时候更加天真，挺好的。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"德克萨斯，你要跟我一起去吗？","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"法院？","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"你知道的，我对人头攒动的庆典不感兴趣，对那种涉及一大堆文件的公务更不感冒。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德克萨斯","text":"我留在这里，负责莱昂的安全......暂时应该也没有比我更合适的人了吧？","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_1028_texas2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"谢谢你，德克萨斯。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"其实，如果你当时和我们一起留在新沃尔西尼——","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":417},{"type":"multiline","name":"德克萨斯","text":"我说过，朋友出事，我就会来帮忙——","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1028_texas2_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":419},{"type":"multiline","name":"德克萨斯","end":"true","text":"我这不是来了吗。","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":422},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":423},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":424},{"type":"charslot","id":425},{"type":"background","id":426},{"type":"image","id":427}],"characters":["伊雷妮","索默尔","家族成员","卡车司机","私人医生","拉维妮娅","？？？","德克萨斯"]}